* TB1: 24V Input TVS Clamping and Reverse Protection (Littelfuse SMBJ30A & SS56)
* Static DC sweep across -30V to +50V with Rsrc=0.5 ohm
Vin in_src 0 DC 24
Rsrc in_src v24_in 0.5
D14 0 v24_in DSS56
.model DSS56 D(Is=1e-7 Rs=0.02 N=1.05 Bv=60)
Rfuse v24_in fused_logic 0.15
D_tvs 0 fused_logic DSMBJ30A
.model DSMBJ30A D(Is=1e-12 Bv=34.5 Ibv=1m Rs=1.12)
D2 fused_logic prot_logic DSS36
.model DSS36 D(Is=1e-7 Rs=0.03 N=1.05 Bv=60)
Cbulk prot_logic 0 110uF
Rload prot_logic 0 48
.dc Vin -30 50 1
.control
run
wrdata tb1_out.txt v(v24_in) v(fused_logic) v(prot_logic)
quit
.endc
.end
